# QlibPro — Indian Algo Trading Desk

Single-page, all-in-one **algo trading terminal for Indian markets (NSE/BSE · CASH + F&O)**, in the spirit of the desk-style screenshot referenced in `WhatsApp Image 2026-11-08 at 7.47.44 AM.jpeg` — watchlist, candle chart with EMA overlays + signal markers, AI signal scan, depth ladder, order ticket, live positions P&L, paper-equity curve, market breadth, risk guards and a HALT kill-switch — **all on one page**, connected to the **Groww Trading API**.

> **Status: v0.1 draft example** — the feed is **simulated** (clearly badged "SIM FEED"); orders run in **paper mode** by default. Live NSE order routing via Groww is wired and gated behind an explicit token + kill-switch. See `docs/PLAN.md` for the full draft plan, architecture, Groww API notes, safety model and roadmap.

Two front-ends ship in this repo:

- **QlibPro Desk** (`/desk.html`) — the "screenshot" experience: an adaptation of the MIT-licensed [GrokDesk](https://github.com/GrokDesk/grokdesk) single-file terminal, re-targeted to Indian markets (Nifty/Sensex/BankNifty/India VIX + 12 NSE F&O stocks), sharing the same paper ledger (localStorage) and the same `/api/order` Groww router. Includes the full agent-desk hex hive (QLIB CORE), signal stream, risk/roster feed and F-key quick orders (**F1** kill-halt · **F2/F3** quick BUY/SELL on the featured symbol · `h` toggles halt). Footer links back to the classic UI.
- **Classic UI** (`/`) — the structured React pro-desk (watchlist, lightweight-charts candles with EMA/Signals, spectrogram, order ticket, positions, Groww settings flow).

## Quickstart

```bash
npm install
npm run build
npm start          # → http://localhost:8787   (classic UI)
                   #   → http://localhost:8787/desk.html   (QlibPro Desk — GrokDesk-adapted)
```

Dev mode with hot reload (UI on :5173, API proxied to :8787):

```bash
npm run server     # terminal 1 — API/static server
npm run dev        # terminal 2 — Vite dev server
```

## What you get out of the box

- **LIVE data (default)**: when a Groww token is connected, prices, candles (5m/15m/1H/1D), depth (Top-5) and order routing all come from the real Groww API — **no simulated fallback**. Without a token the desk shows dashes, never fabricated ticks.
- **PAPER mode (opt-in, off by default)**: ₹10,00,000 paper capital, instant fills at simulated LTP ± slippage — enable via Settings (gear) → **PAPER SIMULATION**, or `localStorage qlibpro.paper = '1'`.
- **GROWW LIVE mode**: run the server on a machine with outbound HTTPS to `api.groww.in` → click the gear → paste your Groww **Access Token** (groww.in → Profile → Settings → Trading APIs → Access Token; expires daily 06:00 IST; requires the Trading API subscription). The server validates it against the real API, keeps it in **memory only**, and routes `BUY/SELL` orders to `POST /v1/order/create` with unique `order_reference_id`. Market data remains simulated until Phase 1 of the roadmap (`docs/PLAN.md`).
- **Honest labels everywhere**: PAPER SIM / GROWW LIVE / OFFLINE badges, token-expiry notes, no silent live orders, indices blocked from live orders (F&O required).
- **API**: `/api/ltp` (batched CASH LTP incl. indices), `/api/quote` (snapshot + depth), `/api/candles` (OHLCV history), `/api/groww/connect|disconnect|status`, `/api/order` (routes SENSEX → BSE, others → NSE), `/api/groww/proxy/*`.

## Repo layout

```
docs/PLAN.md        First-draft plan (architecture, Groww API map, risk model, roadmap, open questions)
server.js           Express: static SPA + /api health + Groww connect/status/proxy/order router
src/marketSim.js    Seeded simulated feed (OHLCV, ticks, depth, breadth) — swappable for Groww quotes
src/strategy.js     EMA(9/21) + RSI(14) + ATR signal scan (stable, computed from closed candles)
src/paper.js        Paper ledger, Indian charges model, INR formatting (en-IN), persistence
src/components/*    Tape, Watchlist, CandleChart, EquityCurve, SignalPanel, DepthBook, Positions, OrderTicket, Settings, Toasts
src/App.jsx         Layout + state wiring    src/styles.css   Terminal theme
```

## Notes & disclaimers

- Equity and F&O involve **substantial risk**. QlibPro is a tool, **not investment advice**. Simulated ≠ live performance.
- **Do not expose port 8787 to the public internet** without an auth layer; this build has no user auth.
- Groww Trading APIs support **equity (CASH) and F&O only** — no MCX. Tokens expire **daily 06:00 IST**.
- Charges shown are estimates; refer to your contract note.
- Keep your access token secret. `.env` is git-ignored; tokens are never logged or sent to the browser.
